    Fix Matrix Room Topic Update (#6827)
    
    Our current Matrix roo topic updates are broken.
    The reason seems to be the API complaining about the HTTP call we do:
    
    ```json
    {
      "errcode":"M_NOT_JSON",
      "error":"Invalid Content-Type header: expected application/json"
    }
    ```
    
    This should hopefully fix the problem. It also finally switches from
    using the actual username and password to just using a pre-generated
    token.
    
    
